{"id":"opozdanie","lemma":"опоздание","pos":"noun","rank":3250,"glosses":["delay","being late, lateness, tardiness"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a8/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"опоздания","plural":"опоздания"},"examples":[{"text":"Извините за опоздание.","en":"Excuse me for being late.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/679174","words":[{"g":"to excuse","l":"извинить"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]},{"text":"Прошу у всех прощения за опоздание.","en":"I am sorry to all of you for being late.","words":[{"g":"to ask for, to request","l":"просить"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"all","l":"весь"},{"g":"forgiveness, pardon","l":"прощение"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]},{"text":"Вы можете объяснить причину своего опоздания?","en":"Can you explain why you were late?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to explain"},null,{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Простите меня, пожалуйста, за опоздание.","en":"Please excuse my being late.","words":[{"g":"to excuse","l":"простить"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]},{"text":"Я хотел бы извиниться за опоздание.","en":"I'd like to apologize for being late.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"to apologize"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]}]}